1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
This hackathon adds Meta-powered tools
on top of my existing Music Transformer.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Import a score as editable chords.
Meta starts a background check.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Work on harmony without displaying
the original score.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Choose instruments, rhythms and drums.
Hear the arrangement take shape.

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Reharmonize up to four chords.
Compare three alternatives.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Muse Spark uses tools to search.
My model scores each in context.

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Compare and combine the alternatives.
Apply the changes you want to keep.

8
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Export Harmony, Bass and Drums.
Keep editing in your DAW.

9
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,200
Less setup.
More time to make your music.
